title: Authorizations › Case page › Clinical picture
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042?tab=draft
intro: The clinical picture is a narrow rail beside the draft on 'Clinical picture & draft': diagnosis, the screener chart, the six dimensions of the case's framework, then medications, what stands out and engagement folded. Any item can light the draft sections that use it.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the chart content is generated for every request except R-1042, which is hand-written. At 1024 px and narrower the rail sits under the draft, folded.
---
start s1 "Click 'Clinical picture & draft'\n(or open an old ?tab=picture link)"
decision dW "Wider than 1024 px?"
screen rl "Rail 'Clinical picture' beside the draft, about 340 px"
screen rf "'Clinical picture' under the draft, folded"
click of "Click 'Clinical picture' to open it"

group gR "The rail, top to bottom"
  screen dx "Diagnosis line, status pill and source chip"
  click ind "Click 'In draft'"
  screen sc "Screener chart: Low to High, one line per screener"
  screen fw "Framework name and six rows\n'ASAM Criteria' or 'LOCUS · adult mental health'\nnumber, short name, dot and rating"
  click row "Click a dimension row"
  overlay pop "Pop-up: the dimension, its rating on the framework's scale\nwhat the chart shows, and the source page quoted"
  click sid "Click 'Show in draft'"
  click cl "Click 'Close', X, the dimmed area or Esc"
  click me "Open 'Medications'\nname and dose, source chip"
  click so "Open 'What stands out'\nfour short lines"
  click en "Open 'Engagement'\npercent, bar and three ticked checks"
endgroup

process lt "The draft sections that cite the same chart page turn green for a few seconds\nand the first scrolls into view"
decision dCt "Does any section cite that page?"
process fb "The section the item speaks to lights instead\ne.g. the diagnosis lights 'Clinical picture'"
click ch "Click the source chip"

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Source chip"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Screener chart"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Framework: ASAM or LOCUS"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Read and edit"

s1 --> dW
dW -->|Yes| rl
dW -->|No| rf --> of --> rl
rl --> dx & sc & fw
dx --> ind --> dCt
dx --> ch --> g1
sc --> g2
fw --> row --> pop
pop --> sid --> dCt
pop --> cl
fw --> g3
rl --> me & so & en
dCt -->|Yes| lt
dCt -->|No| fb
lt --> g4
fb --> g4
